## 4c. fmix_bench_20260715/ — fmix quality benchmark (7 configs × 3 A × 3 snapshots)

Subdirectory `circuits/fmix_bench_20260715/` holds **63 raw fmix circuits** (no
fcompress) for benchmarking mix quality across configs and dose. Base: **3
independently sampled** sandwich A's (`compose_A.py(genran C n128 m3000, genran D
n128 m3000)` = 6768 g57 / 256 wires each, self-tested). The A's are kept
**server-only** (`.242:~/tds/bench/A{1,2,3}.txt`) and are deliberately NOT in this
repo.

Each A × 7 configs, all: `--input-format g57 --k-max 20 --split-damp 2
--target-size 500000 --moves 5000000 --no-local-verify --verify-every 50000
--twist-min-len 256`, current directional-walk fmix (commit `066f4c00`+, built on
.242). Base weights **neg .02 / swap .05 / cnot .05 / unsub .05 / fresh .05 /
insert .05 / cross = remainder**; each config overrides one thing:

| config | change | temp |
|---|---|---|
| `defaults` | base | 5000 (default) |
| `temp2500` | — | 2500 (½ default) |
| `temp10000` | — | 10000 (2× default) |
| `swap10` | swap .10 (cross .68) | default |
| `trans10` | cnot .10 (cross .68) | default |
| `no_swaptrans` | swap 0, cnot 0 (cross .83) | default |
| `no_insert` | insert 0 (cross .78) | default |

Files per config: `<A><cfg>.final.txt` (5M moves) + `.snapshot.txt.mv2000000` +
`.snapshot.txt.mv3000000`, each with an `.origins` sidecar; all mpmct1, ~494K
gates. Naming `A{1,2,3}_{config}.{final|snapshot.txt.mvN}`. Integrity: header
gate-count == line-count on all 63. Observation from the run: the swap+cnot twist
load (0.10) ran ~2.5× slower than the neg-only `no_swaptrans` config (twist dose
has a real throughput cost). Source: session 2026-07-15/16, `run_bench.sh`.

