First production circuit through the PRODUCT-SHARE nonlinear encoding (commits
55e91dc1 encoding+towers; 66ddec18/96113b1b docs). The balanced nonlinear
share decode v = w_u ^ w_u' ^ XOR PROD(w^a) ^ c removes the computational-
progress diagonal (see docs/PRODUCT_SHARE_ENCODING.{md,tex,pdf}). Pipeline:
  fresh C (128w x 3000 g57, SECRET, server-side only) ->
  sliced_sandwich_cnot (m_C=m_D=3000, s=896) = 7920 g / 256w ->
  product-share gadgetize (gen_sandwich_gadget, mixed encoding
  PROD_K=2 PROD_DEG=2 PROD_K_HI=2 PROD_DEG_HI=3 => plan [2,2,3,3], band 64):
  374478 g / 576 w, endpoint verify PASSED (low-256 == sandwich, 200 samples) ->
  fmix (FROZEN_DB_DIR=frozen_m1_m11, guards deg9/span30/terms 1024:2048):
  - PHASE A (hold size, DB-mixing dose): --w-db 1.0 --no-local-verify
    --p-twist 0.0016 neg-only, target 374478, 3M moves -> 392115 g (seed 31).
    NOTE generation targeting is INFEASIBLE here (wide mask gates are
    DB-re-encoding-ineligible, 5th-pct generation pinned at 0); a fixed dose
    is used instead.
  - PHASE B (grow x3): default k12/split-base2.0 --no-local-verify
    (the exhaustive per-rewrite verify caps support at 24 wires and panics on
    the wide gates; whole-circuit --verify-every still runs), --p-twist 0.001,
    target 1123434, 15M moves -> 1127387 g (seed 31). x3.01 of the gadget.
  Final: 1127387 gates, 576 wires. Eval on the ZERO SLICE: inject x on wires
  0..127, all other wires (128..575) = 0 -> C(x) appears on wires 128..255.
  hmap_affine vs original C (n=128, deg-1, meta server-side ~/tds/prodshare/hmaps):
    plain gadget:  depth 0.351 depthMed 0.359 rho 1.00 (diagonal ALIVE)
    mixed gadget:  depth 0.044 depthMed 0.000 rho 0.02 (dead)
    phase A:       depth 0.044 depthMed 0.000 rho 0.02 (dead)
    phase B (x3):  depth 0.044 depthMed 0.000 rho 0.02 (dead)
    mixed gadget deg-2 (band-restricted): depthMed 0.000 rho -0.04 (dead)
  The encoding kills the degree-1 AND degree-2 diagonal and it stays dead
  identically through mixing + x3 growth. Plates:
  reports/prod_share_20260723/. Source C + sandwich + gadget + phase-A
  intermediate + all snapshots kept SERVER-SIDE only (~/tds/prodshare/); only
