    --p-db-ingest 0.25 --p-db-hard 0.05 --db-ctrl-cap 2 --no-local-verify
    --p-twist 0.0016 neg-only, target 281068, --moves 7200000
    -> 472608 g. Eligible-gate lag at stop 1692/295572 = 0.57%.
    NOTE 1: "generation 100" here means over CAP-ELIGIBLE gates. G= (the
    reported 5th-percentile generation over ALL gates) is pinned at 0 by
    construction, because ~62% of the gadget is width>=3 and so is never
